<div class="container my-5">
    <h1 class="mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>
        We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting it through our compliance with this privacy policy (“Policy”).
        This Policy describes the types of information we may collect from you or that you may provide (“Personal Information”)
        on the radhaheritagehomestay.com website (“Website” or “Service”) and any of its related products and services
        (collectively, “Services”), and our practices for collecting, using, maintaining, protecting, and disclosing that
        Personal Information.
    </p>

    <p>
        This Policy is a legally binding agreement between you (“User”, “you” or “your”) and this Website operator (“Operator”,
        “we”, “us” or “our”). By accessing and using the Website and Services, you acknowledge that you have read, understood,
        and agree to be bound by the terms of this Policy.
    </p>

    <hr />

    <h2>Collection of Information</h2>
    <p>
        Our top priority is customer data security and, as such, we exercise the no logs policy. We may process only minimal
        user data, only as much as it is absolutely necessary to maintain the Website and Services. Information collected
        automatically is used only to identify potential cases of abuse and establish statistical information regarding the
        usage and traffic of the Website and Services.
    </p>

    <h2>Use and Processing of Collected Information</h2>
    <p>
        We act as a data controller and a data processor when handling Personal Information, unless we have entered into a data
        processing agreement with you. Processing of Personal Information depends on how you interact with the Website and
        Services, your location, and applicable legal obligations.
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Send product and service updates</li>
        <li>Respond to inquiries and provide support</li>
        <li>Request user feedback</li>
        <li>Improve user experience</li>
        <li>Protect against abuse and malicious users</li>
        <li>Comply with legal requirements</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Disclosure of Information</h2>
    <p>
        We may share non-personally identifiable information with trusted service providers solely for operating the Website
        and Services. We do not sell, rent, or trade your Personal Information to unaffiliated third parties.
    </p>

    <h2>Retention of Information</h2>
    <p>
        We retain Personal Information only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this Policy, comply
        with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
        Our Website uses cookies to enhance user experience and collect statistical data. You can choose to accept or decline
        cookies through your browser settings.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Analytics</h2>
    <p>
        We may use third-party analytics tools to analyze usage patterns and improve our Website and Services. These tools do
        not collect personally identifiable information.
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy of Children</h2>
    <p>
        We do not knowingly collect Personal Information from children under the age of 18. If you believe a child has
        provided us with Personal Information, please contact us so we can remove it.
    </p>

    <h2>Do Not Track Signals</h2>
    <p>
        Some browsers include Do Not Track features. Currently, our Website does not respond to these signals, but we limit
        our data collection practices as described in this Policy.
    </p>

    <h2>Links to Other Resources</h2>
    <p>
        Our Website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those
        websites and encourage you to read their privacy policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Information Security</h2>
    <p>
        We implement reasonable security measures to protect your information. However, no method of transmission over the
        Internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Breach</h2>
    <p>
        In the event of a data breach, we will take appropriate action and notify affected users as required by law.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes and Amendments</h2>
    <p>
        We reserve the right to modify this Policy at any time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision
